<title>JAPAN: Sumitomo Precision to issue Euroyen CB.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Precision to issue Euroyen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Sumitomo Precision Products Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Swiss Bank Corp</p>
<p> TYPE yen convertible	ISSUE NO	  AMT   5 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON nil		    ISSU PRICE	MATURITY 21.Oct.00</p>
<p>CONV PRICE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 05.Nov.96    CONV TO 04.Oct.00</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	     PAY DATE 21.Oct.96   INT PAY</p>
